 : DATA CREATE ALLOT ( NAME ) , ( AGE ) ;
 15 30 DATA NAME_1

 Just putting 15 won't work. SPARCs have 4-bytes alignement restriction too,
 for example. And on and on. And RECORD structures ARE VERY USEFUL.

